왜

- API는 GET /v1/webhook-endpoints에서 status(기본 active)를 받고 archived_at을 돌려주지만, SDK의 listWebhookEndpoints는 인자가 없고 WebhookEndpointResponse에 archived_at이 없었다. SDK로는 보관한 엔드포인트를 조회할 수 없고, 기본 목록에서 빠진 엔드포인트가 보관인지 삭제인지 구분할 수 없었다.

변경 사항

- listWebhookEndpoints가 다른 목록처럼 status?: ArchiveStatus를 받아 query로 보낸다. 인자 없는 기존 호출은 그대로 동작한다.
- WebhookEndpointResponse에 archived_at을 더했다.
- status=archived를 보내고 archived_at을 돌려받는지 보는 시험을 더했다.

검증

- 고치기 전 새 시험이 expected: 'archived', actual: null로 실패했고 tsc가 TS2554 Expected 0 arguments, but got 1을 냈다. 고친 뒤 demo/sdk의 test 26건, typecheck, lint 통과.
---
 demo/sdk/src/meter-engine-client.ts |  4 ++--
 demo/sdk/src/read-contract.test.ts  | 12 ++++++++++++
 demo/sdk/src/types.ts               |  1 +
 3 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/demo/sdk/src/meter-engine-client.ts b/demo/sdk/src/meter-engine-client.ts
index 5355b45d..d92562fd 100644
--- a/demo/sdk/src/meter-engine-client.ts
+++ b/demo/sdk/src/meter-engine-client.ts
@@ -117,8 +117,8 @@ export class MeterEngineClient {
     return this.request("POST", `/v1/customers/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/payment-method-registrations`, undefined, undefined, false);
   }
 
-  listWebhookEndpoints(): Promise<ListWebhookEndpointsResponse> {
-    return this.request("GET", "/v1/webhook-endpoints");
+  listWebhookEndpoints(params: { status?: ArchiveStatus } = {}): Promise<ListWebhookEndpointsResponse> {
+    return this.request("GET", queryPath("/v1/webhook-endpoints", params));
   }
 
   listWebhookDeliveries(id: string, params: { page?: number; size?: number; status?: string } = {}): Promise<ListWebhookDeliveriesResponse> {
diff --git a/demo/sdk/src/read-contract.test.ts b/demo/sdk/src/read-contract.test.ts
index 0acaadfd..f6dccbff 100644
--- a/demo/sdk/src/read-contract.test.ts
+++ b/demo/sdk/src/read-contract.test.ts
@@ -14,3 +14,15 @@ test("서버 응답이 유실된 카드 등록 링크를 자동으로 다시 만
   await assert.rejects(client.createPaymentMethodRegistration(CUSTOMER_ID));
   assert.equal(calls, 1);
 });
+
+test("웹훅 엔드포인트 목록은 보관 상태를 query로 보내고 archived_at을 돌려준다", async () => {
+  const urls: string[] = [];
+  const client = new MeterEngineClient({ baseUrl: "http://localhost:8080", apiKey: API_KEY, fetch: async (input) => {
+    urls.push(String(input));
+    return new Response(JSON.stringify({ endpoints: [{ id: "c0b1a2d3-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", url: "https://example.com/hook", event_types: ["invoice.finalized"], enabled: false, description: null, created_at: "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", archived_at: "2026-10-02T00:00:00Z" }] }), { status: 200 });
+  } });
+  const response = await client.listWebhookEndpoints({ status: "archived" });
+  assert.equal(new URL(urls[0]).pathname, "/v1/webhook-endpoints");
+  assert.equal(new URL(urls[0]).searchParams.get("status"), "archived");
+  assert.equal(response.endpoints[0].archived_at, "2026-10-02T00:00:00Z");
+});
diff --git a/demo/sdk/src/types.ts b/demo/sdk/src/types.ts
index 24f929bd..0e8622b3 100644
--- a/demo/sdk/src/types.ts
+++ b/demo/sdk/src/types.ts
@@ -177,6 +177,7 @@ export interface WebhookEndpointResponse {
   enabled: boolean;
   description: string | null;
   created_at: string;
+  archived_at?: string | null;
   secret?: string;
 }
 
